# Day 47 – Build Content Intelligence Studio

## 60 Days of Claude AI Challenge

Today I built an **AI-Powered Content Intelligence Studio** designed to analyze content and provide intelligent, actionable recommendations.

## What I Learned

- **Content Intelligence:** Analyze content using specialized AI reviewers instead of generic feedback.
- **Multimodal AI:** Review and analyze both text and images using AI vision capabilities.
- **SaaS Dashboard:** Design professional dashboards with scoring, reports, and visual insights.
- **AI Optimization:** Generate improved content, actionable recommendations, and executive summaries using AI reasoning.

## What I Built

An interactive **Content Intelligence Studio** that helps users analyze and optimize their content with AI.

### Key Features
- AI-powered content analysis
- Multiple specialized AI reviewers
- Text and image analysis
- Content scoring and insights
- Actionable recommendations
- Content optimization suggestions
- Professional SaaS-style dashboard

## Key Takeaway

AI can go beyond generating content. By combining specialized reviewers, multimodal analysis, and structured recommendations, AI can become a powerful tool for understanding and improving content.

